Virta

The DABA Lite implementation is adapted to C# from the
Apache-2.0-licensed IBM sliding-window-aggregators reference implementations:
https://github.com/IBM/sliding-window-aggregators

Virta changes its storage, cursor representation, operator dispatch, public
interfaces, resource management, and validation.

Algorithm authors: Kanat Tangwongsan, Martin Hirzel, and Scott Schneider.
